### Register User
POST {{base}}/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Aamir Khan",
  "email": "Azamir865@gmail.com",
  "mobileNumber": "8290556412",
  "password": "1234560",
  "confirmPassword": "1234560"
} 



### LOGIN API
# @name login
POST {{base}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json  

{
  "email": "azamir865@gmail.com",
  "password": "1234560"
}

### TOKEN VARIABLE (Auto-captured from Login above)
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}



### REGISTER EMPLOYEE API
POST {{base}}/api/employees/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Rahul Sharma",
  "email": "rahul123@gmail.com",
  "mobileNumber": "9876543210",
  "employeeId": "EMP002",
  "designation": "Software Engineer",
  "joiningDate": "2026-11-17",
  "password": "123456",
  "confirmPassword": "123456"
}

#### all employees API get 
GET {{base}}/api/employees/get-all
Content-Type: application/json


### DELETE EMPLOYEE BY MONGO ID OR EMPLOYEE ID
DELETE {{base}}/api/employees/delete/6afd6b7da7d49af365c099d8
Content-Type: application/json 


### EDIT EMPLOYEE (By MongoDB _id)
PUT {{base}}/api/employees/edit/6afd6b7da7d49af365c099d8
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "fullName": "aby",
    "email": "abUy@gmail.com",
    "mobileNumber": "917568138275",
    "employeeId": "8752",
    "designation": "WEBDESIGNER hys",
    "joiningDate": "2026-10-30T00:00:00.000+00:00"
}


### EDIT EMPLOYEE (By Custom employeeId e.g. 875 or 343)
PUT {{base}}/api/employees/edit/343
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "designation": "Lead Full Stack Developer"
}

###VIEW EMPLOYEE API
GET {{base}}/api/employees/view/EMP002
Content-Type: application/json 

### LOGOUT USER API
POST {{base}}/api/users/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
